@baseUrl = https://localhost:8000

###
# CI/CD SMOKE TESTS
# Minimal tests to verify deployment
# Run these after every deployment
###

### ? HEALTH CHECK: API is running
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ? HEALTH CHECK: Tribes endpoint works
GET {{baseUrl}}/tribes?world=pl244

### ? AUTH: Login endpoint accessible
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google

### ? CRITICAL PATH: Create ? Upload ? Configure ? Generate ? Verify
###

### 1. Create Schedule
# @name smokeSchedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CI Smoke Test",
  "world": "pl244",
  "scheduleType": "Reconnaissance",
  "enemyTribalWarsIds": [123]
}

###
@smokeScheduleId = {{smokeSchedule.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Upload Troops
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{smokeScheduleId}}/troops
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rawData": "12345\t67890\t500\t501\t100\t50\t30\t20\t150\t10\t5\t8\t0\t0"
}

### 3. Configure Settings
PUT {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{smokeScheduleId}}/reconnaissance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2026-02-15T08:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2026-02-15T12:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2026-02-15T18:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 3,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true
}

### 4. Generate Actions (CRITICAL - tests Generator.Api integration)
# @name smokeGenerate
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{smokeScheduleId}}/reconnaissance/actions

### 5. Verify Generation
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{smokeScheduleId}}/reconnaissance/actions

### 6. Cleanup
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{smokeScheduleId}}

###
# Expected Results:
# - All requests return 2xx status codes
# - Generation returns generatedCommandsCount > 0
# - Total execution time < 5 seconds
###
